# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  GunZ Source — .gitignore
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─────────── Visual Studio ───────────
.vs/
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.opendb
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.vcxproj.user
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb
UpgradeLog*.htm
UpgradeLog*.XML

# ─────────── Build output folders (all projects, all configs) ───────────
# This catches all .exe .lib .dll .obj inside build folders automatically
Build/
**/Release/
**/Release_Desperate/
**/Debug/
**/x64/
**/x86/
**/ipch/

# ─────────── Compiled objects ───────────
*.obj
*.o
*.lo
*.slo
*.d

# ─────────── Linker intermediates ───────────
*.exp
*.ilk
*.pdb
*.idb
*.ipdb
*.iobj
*.map

# ─────────── Build system intermediates ───────────
*.log
*.tlog
*.recipe
*.FileListAbsolute.txt
*.lastbuildstate
*.unsuccessfulbuild

# ─────────── Resource compiler output ───────────
*.res

# ─────────── Precompiled headers ───────────
*.pch
*.gch

# ─────────── COM type libraries (auto-generated by #import) ───────────
*.tlh
*.tli

# ─────────── Static/Shared libraries (Linux/Mac only) ───────────
*.a
*.la
*.lai
*.so
*.dylib

# ─────────── Misc ───────────
*.out
*.app
*.dmp
*.bak
*.cache
*.tmp
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ─────────── NuGet ───────────
packages/

# ─────────── EOS SDK tool binaries ───────────
EOS/SDK/Tool/*.exe
EOS/Samples/.vs/

# ─────────── Generated headers ───────────
Gunz/stdafx.h
